                                "sense_id": "4666834e-44c0-3a84-8644-c924e3629348",
                                "text": "At the end of his life he had become, on his own ground, as mellow as he was rich; he combined consummate shrewdness with the disposition superficially to fraternise, and his \"social position,\" on which he had never wasted a care, had the firm perfection of an unthumbed fruit."
