                                "sense_id": "4666834e-44c0-3a84-8644-c924e3629348",
                                "text": "Beside the table, bare except for the formal, unthumbed Bible, Mrs. Horowitz rattled out a paper, her near-sighted eyes traveling back and forth across the page."
